{% comment %}
  02 — THE HOUSE
{% endcomment %}

<section class="section-padding border-top-thin" id="the-house">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid-asymmetric-left gsap-reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="editorial-label">02 — THE HOUSE MANIFESTO</span>
        <h2 class="headline-section font-serif" style="margin-top: 16px;">
          LESS MARKETING.<br>
          MORE CONCENTRATION.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-soft" style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          AGHA was founded on a simple refusal: to compromise scent integrity for mass production. Where traditional fragrance houses dilute extracts to 12–15% alcohol solutions, we compound our extraits de parfum at an uncompromised 35% oil concentration.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted" style="margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Every formula is macerated for 90 days in temperature-controlled dark chambers, allowing natural botanicals to deepen into complex, atmospheric signatures that evolve over 12+ hours on skin.
        </p>

        <div style="margin-top: 32px;">
          <a href="#art" class="btn-secondary">
            <span>OUR CRAFT PHILOSOPHY</span>
            <span class="btn-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gsap-clip-reveal" style="aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <img src="{{ 'hero_perfume_bottle.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Agha Perfumery House" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.1);">
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Proof Statistics -->
    <div class="house-stats-grid gsap-reveal">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-number">35%</span>
        <span class="stat-label">PURE OIL CONCENTRATION</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-number">12–14</span>
        <span class="stat-label">HOURS LONGEVITY ON SKIN</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-number">90 DAYS</span>
        <span class="stat-label">MACERATION PERIOD</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-number">0%</span>
        <span class="stat-label">SYNTHETIC FILLERS</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
